Acceptance criteria
-------------------
Existing source/assets/entry paths, artwork and behavior remain unchanged.
Release archive excludes private context/dependencies/tests/supplied media ROM.
Package manifest and checksum identify the actual output, not a placeholder.
Local package, public website and any future GitHub Release remain distinct.
No automatic tag, GitHub Release, push or new deployment.

